!\MECHCOMMENTS: THERE APPEAR TO BE SOME POORLY DOCUMENTED RATE CONSTANTS IN THE C3H2 AND AROMATIC GROWTH SUB-MODULES. THE C3H3 RECOMBINATION RATE CONSTANTS ARE A MESS. KPS 31 / 07 / 2015
